1311
01:01:01,400 --> 01:01:02,880
Ee.

1312
01:01:02,880 --> 01:01:06,360
And then for ooh, where does it go?

1313
01:01:11,280 --> 01:01:13,040
It moves, right?

1314
01:01:13,040 --> 01:01:14,560
So you aren't just rounding your lips

1315
01:01:14,560 --> 01:01:16,440
and leaving your tongue where it was, yes?

1316
01:01:16,440 --> 01:01:19,440
