1323
01:01:37,040 --> 01:01:39,960
and it avoids my molars, you're absolutely right.

1324
01:01:39,960 --> 01:01:41,680
And it curls backwards, so it's hiding back

1325
01:01:41,680 --> 01:01:42,440
in the back of my mouth.

