1328
01:01:47,040 --> 01:01:49,760
Everybody do some more ee, ooh, ee, ooh, feel your tongue

1329
01:01:49,760 --> 01:01:50,520
moving back and forth.

1330
01:01:50,520 --> 01:01:51,640
Ignore your lips, right?

1331
01:01:51,640 --> 01:01:55,680
And think about your tongue, yeah?

1332
01:01:55,680 --> 01:01:57,120
Yeah?

1333
01:01:57,120 --> 01:02:03,160
OK, so we have high, mid, and low vells,

1334
01:02:03,160 --> 01:02:06,080
but we also have front and back vells.

1335
01:02:06,080 --> 01:02:08,880
So the back vells are vells like the vell in hoo

1336
01:02:08,880 --> 01:02:12,520
and the vell in ho, and the vell in hot, ah.

1337
01:02:12,520 --> 01:02:16,080
So ooh, and oh, and ah, those are all back vells.

1338
01:02:16,080 --> 01:02:19,680
Your tongue is sort of pulling back toward the back of your mouth.

1339
01:02:19,680 --> 01:02:21,920
Yeah?

1340
01:02:21,920 --> 01:02:25,520
And then this is the other point that you guys made.

1341
01:02:25,520 --> 01:02:27,040
Some of these vells are rounded.

1342
01:02:27,040 --> 01:02:32,480
So in English, the back non-low vells, the back high

1343
01:02:32,480 --> 01:02:36,880
and the back mid vells, are rounded in hoo and ho.

1344
01:02:36,880 --> 01:02:39,880
Your lips have to round to make those vells.

1345
01:02:39,880 --> 01:02:43,040
But for hot, your lips don't round.

1346
01:02:43,040 --> 01:02:44,240
Yeah?

1347
01:02:44,240 --> 01:02:47,280
And a bunch more symbols, some of them aren't so bad.

1348
