Those are sometimes called central vowels.

1429
01:06:34,320 --> 01:06:39,800
So the first vowel in machine is a schwa.

1430
01:06:39,800 --> 01:06:40,920
It's not high or back.

1431
01:06:40,920 --> 01:06:41,800
It's not front.

1432
01:06:41,800 --> 01:06:44,640
It's not high or low.

1433
01:06:44,640 --> 01:06:46,360
It's kind of mid and central.

1434
01:06:46,360 --> 01:06:49,960
And then dove is pretty similar to schwa

1435
01:06:49,960 --> 01:06:52,360
